    "description": "<b>Ball Sort Puzzle</b> is a color sorting game where you sort ball. If you are looking for a sort master - puzzle game to play color sorting puzzle, or searching for ball puzzle games to relax and train your brain, this color ball sort puzzle is great for you.\r\n\r\nBall sort puzzle - color game has very simple rules to play, similar to water sort puzzle, but sort colors can sometimes be challenging. The only rule of ball shot is that you can only move the ball match the top color balls. Ball sort color water puzzle is a really good Ballsort puzzle game to escape the everyday routine.\r\n\r\nThis ball sort puzzle game is suitable for all ages of puzzle game players. For kids, the sort color ball game is good for developing their IQ, and playing bubble sort with your children will also build a bond with them. For Seniors, playing ball sorting can keep you mind sharp and help prevent mental decline. For young and middle-aged people, playing sort ball puzzle is a good way to release stress from work or studies.\r\n\r\nFeatures of <b>Ball Sort Puzzle</b>:\r\n- Quick to start the game, play the ball sort game easily anytime, anywhere, even in a very short time.\r\n- Many interesting color ball sort background, balls (such as marbles, emoji balls, yarn ball, etc.), and ball sorter tubes to choose from.\r\n- More ball sorr undo props to use to avoid unexpected failures.\r\n- 10,000+ different sorting balls games.\r\n- 2,000+ extra challenging ball sort color puzzle games.\r\n- Find the best strategy to solve ball sort puz!\r\n- I bet you will be addicted to our color ball games!\r\n\r\n<b>Ball Sort Puzzle</b> is truly a great game that you won't regret playing! Come and play NOW!",
